#. ja: 汎用規格トームストーン
#. de: universell[a] antik[a] Stein
#. fr: modèle générique de mémoquartz
#. column 2: universal tomestones
#. column 8: Researchers of a long-gone age supposedly constructed this peculiar variety of tomestone with a focus on versatility. When said versatility resulted in limited data storage and transfer capacity, however, they abandoned all hope─and these tomestones with it.
#. column 9: Universal Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:43548:0:0"
msgid "universal tomestone"
msgstr ""

#. de: universell[a] antik[a] Steine
